{
  "about": [
    "Test vectors for the matcher, run by both extension/test/matcher.test.js and tests/test_matcher.py so the two",
    "implementations cannot drift. Each case matches text against entries (with the rules in \"without\" switched off) and",
    "expects these spans: options as the entries' Japanese, in entry order. start and end count UTF-16 code units, as",
    "JavaScript strings do; the Python test converts its code-point offsets. forms: matcher word forms of a word for the",
    "parts of speech given (null: all). kinds: an entry's parts of speech. alternatives: a gloss's English alternatives."
